- **Direct-call-only** profiles ({{DIRECT_CALL_ONLY}}) are never automatic
  routing destinations. They run only when the user explicitly asks for them.
- **Every profile runs on an Anthropic model.** This machine removed all
  external-model use on 2026-07-26, and `apply.py` now fails the build rather
